{
  "total_duration": 669.284,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.92,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你可能会以为，fire 被 put out 以后，危险就结束了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 4.27,
      "end": 11.134,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但这一课要看的是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "after the fire"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "：火灭以后，山坡还可能威胁村庄。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 11.484,
      "end": 15.524,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为树和草被烧掉后，soil 没有 roots 抓住。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 15.873,
      "end": 24.129,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "冬天的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "heavy rain"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "一来，土会被冲走，还可能造成"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "floods"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 24.479,
      "end": 32.079,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以今天的关键不是火焰，而是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "soil, roots, rain, and patches of green"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 32.429,
      "end": 35.709,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看这场火为什么不简单。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 36.059,
      "end": 42.479,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：消防员和森林大火搏斗了将近三周，最后才把火势控制住。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 42.829,
      "end": 48.973,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文开头是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Firemen had been fighting the forest fire for nearly three weeks"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 49.322,
      "end": 56.282,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Had been fighting"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "表示在“终于控制住”之前，这个动作已经持续了很久。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 56.632,
      "end": 60.872,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后半句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "before they could get it under control"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 61.222,
      "end": 67.286,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Get it under control"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是把火势控制住，不让它继续失控蔓延。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 67.636,
      "end": 73.244,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "had been fighting, nearly three weeks, under control"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 73.594,
      "end": 77.074,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，看火灭以后留下的空旷和危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 77.423,
      "end": 87.423,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：不久之前，参天大树还覆盖着方圆数英里的乡野；现在，只剩发热的地面、烟和荒凉山丘。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 87.773,
      "end": 94.401,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A short time before, great trees had covered the countryside for miles around"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 94.751,
      "end": 100.439,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这句用"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "had covered"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，把我们带回更早以前的绿色画面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 100.789,
      "end": 107.685,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着画面一转："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Now, smoke still rose up from the warm ground over the desolate hills"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 108.035,
      "end": 114.419,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Desolate"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是荒凉、空空的感觉，不是热闹的火场，而是火后的空地。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 114.768,
      "end": 120.592,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住对比："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "great trees before, desolate hills now"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 120.942,
      "end": 124.942,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，真正的威胁来了：不是火，而是雨。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 125.292,
      "end": 135.092,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：冬天快来了，大雨不仅会冲走土壤，还会造成严重洪水，所以山丘威胁周围村庄。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 135.442,
      "end": 141.566,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Winter was coming on and the hills threatened the surrounding villages with destruction"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 141.916,
      "end": 147.836,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Threatened ... with ..."
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是用某种危险威胁某人或某地。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 148.186,
      "end": 155.161,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "原因在后面："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "for heavy rain would not only wash away the soil but would cause serious floods as well"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 155.511,
      "end": 164.023,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "for"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接近 because，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "not only ... but ... as well"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "说明有两层危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 164.373,
      "end": 169.765,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "wash away the soil, cause serious floods"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 170.115,
      "end": 173.315,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，看人们怎样让绿色先回来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 173.665,
      "end": 183.185,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：大火终于扑灭以后，森林管理部门订购快速生长的草籽，飞机把种子大量撒到地面上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 183.534,
      "end": 191.938,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When the fire had at last been put out, the forest authorities ordered several tons of a special type of grass-seed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 192.288,
      "end": 199.752,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Forest authorities"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是负责森林管理的人或部门；草籽要能快速生长。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 200.102,
      "end": 206.342,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后是行动："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The seed was sprayed over the ground in huge quantities by aeroplanes"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 206.692,
      "end": 213.604,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "雨开始下的时候，很多地方的草已经扎根："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the grass had already taken root"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 213.954,
      "end": 221.354,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后，黑色土壤上出现希望："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "patches of green had begun to appear in the blackened soil"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 221.703,
      "end": 227.327,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "grass seed, take root, patches of green"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 227.677,
      "end": 232.401,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，火都已经 put out 了，为什么 hills 还会 threaten villages？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 232.75,
      "end": 239.55,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为火灭了，只是第一场战斗结束。山坡上少了 trees 和 grass，soil 就松了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 239.9,
      "end": 243.614,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Soil 松了，heavy rain 一冲，就会被 wash away？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 243.964,
      "end": 249.244,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。你可以想象一盆没有植物的土，水一倒下去，土很容易流走。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 249.593,
      "end": 254.038,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那 floods 是因为水和泥会一起往村庄方向冲？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 254.388,
      "end": 262.868,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是的。所以这课的危险链是：没有 roots 抓住 soil，heavy rain 来了，soil 被 wash away，floods 就可能出现。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 263.217,
      "end": 267.493,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那为什么要先撒 grass seed，不直接等大树长回来？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 267.843,
      "end": 276.803,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为大树恢复要很久，grass grows fast。先让草"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "take root"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，就像给山坡先缝上一层保护线。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 277.153,
      "end": 282.317,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以 patches of green 不是说森林马上回来了，而是恢复开始了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 282.667,
      "end": 290.791,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "正好。"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Lesson 62"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最温柔的地方就在这里：黑色土地上，先出现一点点 green。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 291.141,
      "end": 297.069,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Firemen had been fighting the forest fire for nearly three weeks before they could get it under control."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 297.419,
      "end": 302.363,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A short time before, great trees had covered the countryside for miles around."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 302.712,
      "end": 307.344,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Now, smoke still rose up from the warm ground over the desolate hills."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 307.694,
      "end": 316.694,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Winter was coming on and the hills threatened the surrounding villages with destruction, for heavy rain would not only wash away the soil but would cause serious floods as well."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 317.044,
      "end": 324.556,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When the fire had at last been put out, the forest authorities ordered several tons of a special type of grass-seed which would grow quickly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 324.906,
      "end": 329.394,
      "speaker": "B",
